528	     * up to 500 nodes, plus a targeted search biased toward all-black
529	     * ancestor chains); a genuine climb-to-root was not found and is left
530	     * to the fuzzer's existing >=10^5-op coverage rather than forced into
531	     * a table row -- the spec's table-driven requirement (NOTES.md:58-60)
532	     * names red leaf / black-leaf-with-red-sibling / two-children / root
